From 15624e7b60e8a7305879cae2ae82a6c4c35eef03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnab Sadhukhan <arnab@Arnabs-Mac-Mini.local>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 19:25:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 035/140] feat(navidrome): add Navidrome / Subsonic media
 server integration and shared music UI

Implement complete support for Navidrome (Subsonic API) as a first-class media
server alongside Jellyfin, and refactor music browser components into reusable
shared modules.

Key highlights:
- Subsonic REST API client with salt/token MD5 authentication and SSL support
- Navidrome server persistence with Room entity, DAO, and database migration
- Shared UI refactoring for server dialogs and music browsing components
- Full music library exploration (Songs, Albums, Artists, Playlists, Detail Sheets)
- Integration into MainScreen navigation, media server preferences, and audio player
